  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "道教文化與術數",
    "sub_ename": "TAOIST CULTURE AND THE MANTIC ARTS",
    "describe_ch": "道教是一個博大精深的中華文化寶庫。道教豐富的宗教習俗和生命智慧，構成了大多數民眾的信仰內容和精神力量。\n    由於道教蘊含中國二千多年的宗教傳統，又涉及複雜多樣的經籍、儀式、符咒、修煉和道派，而在其歷史發展中，又結合了中國地方社會多元、複雜的宗教文化及習俗。  \n    因此，本課程之設計宗旨，是幫助學生對道教文化，建立一個宏觀的認識。\n此外，旨於培養學生公民素養與加強學生社會實踐力。\n",
    "describe_eh": "Taoism is a vast and profound treasure house of Chinese culture. Taoism’s rich religious customs and life wisdom constitute the content and spiritual strength of the majority of the people.\nBecause Taoism contains more than two thousand years of Chinese religious traditions, it also involves complex and diverse scriptures, rituals, charms, practices, and Taoism. In its historical development, it has combined the diverse and complex religious culture and customs of the local Chinese society. Therefore, the design purpose of this course is to help students establish a macro understanding of Taoist culture.In addition, it aims to cultivate students' civic literacy and strengthen students' social practice.\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "引導學生從文化的立場，去了解道教豐富的宗教習俗和生命智慧。",
      "describe_en": "Guide students to understand the rich religious customs and life wisdom of Taoism from a cultural standpoint."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "協助學生運用批判思考，進而提升其公民素養與社會實踐能力。",
      "describe_en": "To help students use critical thinking to improve their civic literacy and social practice ability."
    }
  ],
